/-!
# Authored native generation, meaning, checking and search

One computed installation produces constructor and position families,
dependent continuation types, cube formers and the common native grammar.
Its checker and fair retained search have an earned interpretation in the
original binding clone with actual operational receipts. Derived fixed
points consume checked native operator and monotonicity certificates.
The actual carrier/reduction theory also enters the existing relative free
extension; its shared logical reading retains constructor and continuation
witnesses without equating that fragment with the entire native grammar.
-/
